# Waby — Design System

Brand: **Waby**. Logo is a butterfly (navy wings + a blue dot). Friendly, rounded, calm.

**Full reference:** `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.  
**Token source of truth:** `lib/core/theme.dart` — use `AppColors` / `kHeaderGradient`, never raw hex in widgets. When tokens or shared widgets change, update `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` in the same change.

## Colours (exact — from `theme.dart`)
- Primary navy `#0F2D54` — main buttons, headings.
- Logo wings / darkest text `#0D1117`.
- Wave-header gradient `#008FB4` → `#7AD0E4` (`kHeaderGradient`, stops 0.31 / 0.88).
- Accent blue `#3B74BC` — links, info pills.
- Value blue `#5187C6` — big stat numbers.
- Logo dot / bright accent `#2AAEE0`.
- Soft light blue `#8ECEE1` — bottom nav, soft accents.
- Field background `#F7F3F3`.
- Safe child card `#E0E8F2`; warning child card `#FBE6E5`; plain cards `#FFFFFF`.
- Status: SAFE green `#56B337`; caution amber `#F0C040`; WARNING / critical red `#C2291D`.
- Alert ramp: soft `#8A9199` → caution `#F0A020` → critical `#C2291D`.

## Typography
Poppins (via `google_fonts`). Big bold headings, bold coloured values, grey secondary text.

## Recurring components
- **Wave header** (`SharedPageHeader`) — `kHeaderGradient` + white wavy bottom edge + page title.
- **Status pill** — `StatusPill` / `StatusTone` (good/bad/neutral).
- **Info pill** — blue rounded chip with icon + label (Latched, Near, 88%).
- **Child card** — avatar + name + DOB/weight + status; tinted by gender/status (safe / warning cards).
- **Metric card** — white rounded card with icon, "LIVE" chip, label, big blue value, subtitle.
- **Primary button** — full-width navy, ~16px radius, bold white text.
- **Bottom nav** — rounded light-blue bar, 3 tabs (Home / Family / Setting).
- **Alert bottom sheet** — escalation colours from `alertSoft` / `alertCaution` / `alertCritical`.

## Icons
Mostly Material Icons. Use exported PNG assets for baby, gender, and family glyphs.
